A URL that is not http(s) is rejected with the entry's index; no out directory is created.

-- fixtures/cwd/projects.json --
[{"name": "ok", "url": "https://pages.example.org/ok"}, {"name": "evil", "url": "javascript:alert(1)"}]
-- cmd --
sh -c 'booping specs site-index --out site < projects.json; s=$?; test -e site && echo site exists; exit $s'
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: projects[1]: `url` must be an http:// or https:// URL
